sub:assertion {
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/thompson1917-ch15-05> delphi:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch15-05--grok> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch15-05--grok> a delphi:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Grok 4.7 on thompson1917-ch15-05: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.65" ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.2.0> ;
    delphi:assessmentType "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0" ;
    delphi:hasScore "0.651"^^xsd:double ;
    delphi:hasVerdict "partially-resolvable" ;
    delphi:hasConfidence "0.7"^^xsd:double ;
    dct:description "Open comparative files are sufficient to ask whether nest type accounts for egg form once female anatomy is considered, which is the contrast Thompson draws with adaptation to nesting. They measure oviduct and pelvic size rather than the varying radial pressure he calls the essential cause. The negative claim about nesting can be examined now; the positive mechanical claim is only proxied, and locomotion-related anatomy remains entangled with it." ;
    rdfs:comment "Proposed test with existing data: Compare models that predict egg asymmetry and elongation from oviduct and pelvic dimensions with models that predict them from nest site and clutch arrangement. The anti-adaptation half is supported if nest variables add little once anatomy is included; the positive claim that radial oviduct pressure is the essential cause still requires a pressure measurement the anatomical sizes only proxy." ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-grok-4.7-high-fast> ;
    delphi:evidenceAgainst "Oviduct diameter and pelvic size are not the radial pressure of successive annuli.", "Flight-related body shape is a third correlate that can mimic an oviduct effect." ;
    delphi:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/thompson1917-ch15-05--grok--dataset-1>, <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/thompson1917-ch15-05--grok--dataset-2> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch15-05--grok--operationalizability> a delphi:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Operationalizability of thompson1917-ch15-05 by Grok 4.7: 0.62" ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.2.0-operationalizability> ;
    delphi:assessmentType "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0/operationalizability" ;
    delphi:hasScore "0.62"^^xsd:double ;
    dct:isPartOf <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch15-05--grok> ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-grok-4.7-high-fast> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/thompson1917-ch15-05> delphi:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch15-05--grok--operationalizability> .
